.TH UNDERTHEC 1 "2026-09-30" "underthec 0.6.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
underthec
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B underthec
[\fB\-c\fR [\fI1.0\fR|\fI1.1\fR]] [\fB\-s\fR] [\fB\-t\fR] [\fB\-p\fR \fIpace\fR]
[\fB\-u\fR \fIN\fR] [\fB\-C\fR \fI1\fR|\fI2\fR|\fI4\fR|\fI7\fR|\fI8\fR|\fI8\-bold\fR|\fI16\fR]
[\fB\-f\fR \fIN\fR] [\fB\-m\fR \fItext\fR|\fB\-\fR] [\fB\-M\fR \fIcolor\fR]
[\fB\-P\fR \fIposition\fR] [\fB\-n\fR \fItext\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-castle\fR]
[\fB\-a\fR \fIdefinition\fR] [\fIteletext options\fR]
.br
.B underthec
{\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-v\fR}
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enjoy the mysteries of the C from the safety of a terminal!

.B underthec
Is a C-port of Asciiquarium v1.1.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-a ", " \-\-aquatic\-life " \fIdefinition\fR"
comma-separated, default: all on, fish=auto
.RS
.PP
.BR fish=<N|auto> ", " ducks ", " dolphins ", " ship ", " swan ", " kaiju ", "
.BR crab ", " shark ", " submarine ", " whale ", " jellyfish ", " monster ", "
.BR bigfish ", " swordfish ", " seahorse ", " rowers ", " sailboat ", "
.BR fishhook ", " turtle
.RE
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-classic " [\fI1.0\fR|\fI1.1\fR]"
classic mode, no arg = 1.0. Not combinable with \fB\-a\fR.
.TP
.BR \-m ", " \-\-message " \fItext\fR"
bg text/ascii art ('\-' for stdin)
.TP
.BR \-M ", " \-\-message\-color " \fIcolor\fR"
\-m text color (default: blue)
.RS
.PP
.BR red ", " green ", " blue ", " yellow ", " magenta ", " cyan ", " white ", " black
.br
capitalized first letter=bold
.RE
.TP
.BR \-P ", " \-\-message\-position " \fIposition\fR"
\-m placement
.RS
.PP
.BR middle : " horizontally+vertically centered (default)"
.br
.BR center : " horizontally centered, vertical top"
.br
.BR marquee : " centered scrolling"
.br
.BR swim : " top row, scrolls right to left"
.br
.BR event : " like swim, but random"
.RE
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-pace " \fIpace\fR"
speed multiplier, 0.01\-10 (default: 1)
.TP
.BR \-u ", " \-\-uturn\-chance " \fIN\fR"
fish turn per N ticks (default: 400, 0 = never)
.TP
.BR \-C ", " \-\-colors " \fInum\fR|\fIname\fR"
foreground colors (default: 16)
.RS
.PP
1|2 also take a \-<color> suffix, e.g. 2\-green
.br
4: RGBW, 7: teletext, 8: also takes 8\-bold
.RE
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-fps " \fIN\fR"
render frames per second, 1\-240 (default: 10)
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-screensaver
exit on any keypress
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-transparent
transparent background (default: opaque black)
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-castle\-name " \fItext\fR"
text on the castle, max 11 chars
.TP
.B \-\-no\-castle
disable the castle
.TP
.BR \-\-teletext " \fIt42\fR|\fIts\fR"
binary teletext stream to stdout instead of the terminal
.RS
.PP
t42: raw 42\-byte packets, ts: MPEG\-TS with teletext PES
.RE
.TP
.BR \-\-teletext\-mode " \fImode\fR"
"text": 39 columns, exact ASCII via X/26
.br
"mosaic": 2x3 blocks, 78 columns (default: text)
.TP
.BR \-\-mcast " \fIIP\fR:\fIPORT\fR"
send MPEG\-TS teletext to a multicast group, [GROUP]:PORT for IPv6
.TP
.BR \-\-ttl " \fIN\fR"
multicast TTL/hops, 1\-255 (default: 1)
.TP
.BR \-\-iface " \fIif\fR"
multicast interface: local address (IPv4) or name (IPv6)
.TP
.BR \-\-teletext\-caption " \fIt\fR"
page caption (default: UNDERTHEC)
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
show help
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
show version
.SH KEYS
.PP
.B q
quit,
.B r
redraw,
.B p/[space]
pause,
.B t
toggle transparency,
.B f
feed,
.B s
settings,
.B h
help
.SH ENVIRONMENT
Each mirrors a command-line option.
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_FISH=auto|number
like \-a's fish=
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_AQUATIC_LIFE=<def>
like \-a, except for fish=
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_CLASSIC=1.0|1.1
like \-c
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_MESSAGE=<text>
like \-m
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_MESSAGE_COLOR=<color>
like \-M
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_MESSAGE_POSITION=<pos>
like \-P
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_PACE=<pace>
like \-p
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_FPS=<N>
like \-f
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_SCREENSAVER=0|1
like \-s
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_UTURN_CHANCE=<N>
like \-u
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_COLORS=<1|1\-*|2|2\-*|7|16>
like \-C
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_TRANSPARENT=0|1
like \-t
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_TELETEXT=t42|ts
like \-\-teletext
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_TELETEXT_MODE=text|mosaic
like \-\-teletext\-mode
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_MCAST=<GROUP:PORT>
like \-\-mcast
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_MCAST_TTL=<N>
like \-\-ttl
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_MCAST_IFACE=<if>
like \-\-iface
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_TELETEXT_CAPTION=<text>
like \-\-teletext\-caption
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_CASTLE_NAME=<text>
like \-\-castle\-name
.PP
.B UNDERTHEC_NO_CASTLE=0|1
like \-\-no\-castle
